        "lastUpdated": "2026-03-06T12:01:06.930000+00:00",
        "longTitleEn": "<p>Bill entitled an Act to protect accuracy in the use of Irish language names and addresses, including the length accenting of vowels, by facilitating the correction of records in accordance with the Data Protection Act 2018, by placing a duty on regulators to ensure that the names and addresses of customers and service users are respected by January 1 2030, and by amending the legislation under which future contracts in respect of the national postcode system are regulated; and to provide for related matters.</p>",
        "longTitleGa": "<p>Bille dá ngairtear Acht chun cruinneas in úsáid ainmneacha agus seoltaí i nGaeilge, lena n-áirítear síneadh fada ar ghutaí, a chosaint, trí cheartúcháin a éascú ar thaifid de réir an Achta um Chosaint Sonraí, 2018, trí dhualgas a chur ar rialálaithe a chinntiú go léirítear meas ar ainmneacha agus seoltaí custaiméirí agus úsáideoirí seirbhíse faoin 1 Eanáir 2030, agus tríd an reachtaíocht a leasú faoina ndéanfar rialáil ar chonarthaí amach anseo do chóras na bpostchód náisiúnta; agus do dhéanamh socrú i dtaobh nithe gaolmhara.</p>",
